lrazak Gurnah |\\n| 2017 | Winner | George ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_winners_and_nominated_authors_of_the_Booker_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d9\"},\"ref\":\"d9\",\"snippet\":\" ... Goes Last (2015) (Winner of the 2015 Red Tentacle award)\\n* Hag-Seed (2016) (Longlisted for the 2017 Women Prize for Fiction)\\n* The Testaments (2019, joint winner of the 2019 Booker Prize)\\\"Margaret Atwood announces sequel to The Handmaid's Tale\\\" . CBC News, November 28, 2018.\\n\\n;Short fiction collections ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Margaret_Atwood\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d28\"},\"ref\":\"d28\",\"snippet\":\" ... shortlisted for the Booker Prize in 2017 and won the Yasnaya Polyana Foreign Fiction Award. He received several international awards, including the Prix Femina, the Israel Prize, the Goethe Prize, the Frankfurt Peace Prize and the 2013 Franz Kafka Prize. He died in 2018 at the age of ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cbc.ca/books/30-books-to-celebrate-30-years-of-writers-company-1.5755144\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d78\"},\"ref\":\"d78\",\"snippet\":\" ... the Bardo, which won the 2017 Man Booker Prize for best work of fiction in English, and was a finalist for the Golden Man Booker, in which one Booker winner was selected to represent each decade, from the fifty years since the Prize's inception.\\n\\nHis stories have ... \",\"title\":\"https://artsandsciences.syracuse.edu/english-department/creative-writing-mf-program/raymond-carver-reading-series/previous-raymond-carver-reading-series/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":